                                "sense_id": "62034e74-6fb7-3f6e-a724-7bbe946fed4c",
                                "text": "Or to put it another way: could a song end your life? Could just one number, performed weedily by Keira Knightley at the beginning of this romcom, cause your body to self-combust at the prospect of enduring 90-odd minutes of a movie obsessed with authenticity but as phoney as a Miley Cyrus dance routine?"
